## 🛡️ Legal Compliance

### For Open Source Users

**You MUST**:
- Comply with AGPL-3.0 terms
- Release source code of all modifications
- Provide source to network service users
- License derivative works under AGPL-3.0
- Preserve copyright notices

**You CANNOT**:
- Use for commercial purposes without commercial license
- Keep modifications proprietary
- Distribute without source code
- Remove copyright notices

### For Commercial Users

**You MUST**:
- Obtain commercial license before commercial use
- Contact copyright holder for licensing
- Comply with commercial license terms
- Pay applicable licensing fees

**You MAY**:
- Evaluate under AGPL-3.0 before purchasing
- Keep modifications proprietary (with commercial license)
- Distribute in closed-source products (with commercial license)
- Negotiate custom terms

